WEBVTT

00:01:40.120 --> 00:01:42.910
I don't care what you 
say, that's too much!

00:01:42.910 --> 00:01:44.520
Too much?

00:01:44.520 --> 00:01:46.710
You want me to take your horse 
carriage, and now this?

00:01:47.080 --> 00:01:48.830
We're basically full.

00:01:48.830 --> 00:01:50.980
If you can't pay, then get lost.

00:01:53.120 --> 00:01:55.500
Looks like I'll have to!

00:01:59.640 --> 00:02:00.540
Damn it.

00:02:00.970 --> 00:02:02.510
Taking advantage of 
our situation, huh?

00:02:02.510 --> 00:02:03.770
Like anybody would pay that!

00:02:04.190 --> 00:02:05.020
What's your problem?

00:02:05.470 --> 00:02:07.900
You don't have to be so cheap.

00:02:07.900 --> 00:02:10.560
You should've just 
rented the whole ship.

00:02:10.560 --> 00:02:13.770
It's fine if I make a decision 
to incur that kind of expense.

00:02:14.100 --> 00:02:16.770
But it's not okay if the other 
side tries to milk us.

00:02:19.410 --> 00:02:20.700
I see.

00:02:20.700 --> 00:02:22.410
So what are we going to do?

00:02:22.920 --> 00:02:24.910
Are you going to try somewhere else?

00:02:28.310 --> 00:02:30.470
Can you stop doing that?

00:02:30.470 --> 00:02:31.490
What's wrong?

00:02:31.490 --> 00:02:32.640
Getting excited?

00:02:32.640 --> 00:02:33.290
No!

00:02:34.990 --> 00:02:37.520
Oh my, oh my!

00:02:37.520 --> 00:02:39.210
What if we went by land?

00:02:42.390 --> 00:02:44.510
I was wondering what it would 
be like if we went by land.

00:02:45.130 --> 00:02:48.780
Well, it would of course 
involve a large detour.

00:02:48.780 --> 00:02:50.520
It would take about ten extra days.

00:02:51.080 --> 00:02:52.610
I want to go to Nanripat.

00:02:53.300 --> 00:02:56.170
It's supposed to have 
special fried sweets.

00:02:57.870 --> 00:02:59.280
What are we waiting for?

00:02:59.280 --> 00:03:03.540
I might even find a way 
to return to my world.

00:03:03.540 --> 00:03:04.690
Oh, right...

00:03:09.950 --> 00:03:12.470
Those sweets are supposed 
to be really good.

00:03:12.470 --> 00:03:14.290
What do you say, Kon? Sainglain?

00:03:14.600 --> 00:03:16.930
Another week or ten days 
isn't so bad now, is it?

00:03:16.930 --> 00:03:19.750
I suppose our journey has 
gone quite smoothly so far.

00:03:19.750 --> 00:03:22.800
What, you don't know the tale 
of the tortoise and the hare?

00:03:23.480 --> 00:03:25.550
You can't be overconfident 
and let your guard down.

00:03:26.010 --> 00:03:28.840
Nobody's following us 
anymore, so why not?

00:03:28.840 --> 00:03:31.500
I guess we could do something 
to lift our spirits

00:03:31.500 --> 00:03:33.310
before we reach the capital.

00:03:33.310 --> 00:03:35.810
Why are you trying to convince me?

00:03:35.810 --> 00:03:40.450
Or is it that there's a famous 
game center in the capital?

00:03:40.450 --> 00:03:42.470
Did you want to go there, Kon?

00:03:42.470 --> 00:03:44.070
Oh, I see!

00:03:44.070 --> 00:03:47.350
You mean the place where you play 
with your life on the line?

00:03:47.350 --> 00:03:49.650
No thanks.

00:03:49.650 --> 00:03:51.320
Detour for the win!

00:03:51.320 --> 00:03:53.460
It'll be our field trip 
before hitting the capital.

00:03:53.460 --> 00:03:56.370
That means we'll need to 
prepare for the trip.

00:03:56.370 --> 00:03:58.330
We're running low on food and water.

00:03:58.330 --> 00:04:00.220
Shall we look around at the market?

00:04:00.220 --> 00:04:01.510
Hey, squirrel thing!

00:04:03.810 --> 00:04:05.990
Don't worry about him. 
He'll be back soon.

00:04:05.990 --> 00:04:07.410
You think so?

00:04:07.410 --> 00:04:09.140
Think he's smart enough?

00:04:09.520 --> 00:04:11.010
About as smart as you.

00:04:11.550 --> 00:04:13.890
He probably had to go do his business.

00:04:13.890 --> 00:04:15.230
Then I'm going, too.

00:04:16.320 --> 00:04:19.730
Let's agree to meet here in one hour.

00:04:19.730 --> 00:04:20.710
Don't be late!

00:04:20.710 --> 00:04:22.360
Roger!

00:04:23.350 --> 00:04:24.750
This is bad!

00:04:24.750 --> 00:04:25.950
There are none!

00:04:25.950 --> 00:04:27.160
No toilets!

00:04:27.590 --> 00:04:30.280
A hole in the ground? Seriously?!

00:04:30.620 --> 00:04:33.230
No stalls, either. 
How open are you guys?

00:04:33.230 --> 00:04:34.920
You think anything can come 
out in conditions like that?

00:04:36.680 --> 00:04:39.530
The afternoon cabaret is tops!

00:04:40.570 --> 00:04:42.300
Excuse me!

00:04:44.120 --> 00:04:46.560
No, no, excuse me.

00:04:51.660 --> 00:04:52.810
Nah, I'm just seeing things.

00:04:53.250 --> 00:04:55.110
Shall we move on to number two?

00:04:55.110 --> 00:04:58.440
Let's go, let's go!

00:04:59.090 --> 00:05:00.360
Oh man.

00:05:00.360 --> 00:05:03.190
It's like I can't even walk anymore, 
even the vibrations are making it worse.

00:05:03.190 --> 00:05:04.660
Somebody...

00:05:04.660 --> 00:05:07.320
She's just a kid, after all.

00:05:08.090 --> 00:05:09.310
I guess once she got here,

00:05:09.310 --> 00:05:11.040
her knees got a little 
weak or something.

00:05:11.040 --> 00:05:12.830
I mean, I understand.

00:05:13.110 --> 00:05:15.210
Poor kid.

00:05:15.930 --> 00:05:18.800
So anyway, that's why they 
changed their destination.

00:05:18.800 --> 00:05:19.860
Sorry.

00:05:20.840 --> 00:05:22.310
Yeah, I'll call again.

00:05:22.310 --> 00:05:24.350
Don't worry, don't worry!

00:05:24.350 --> 00:05:26.340
They'll never know, 
I'm doing a good job.

00:05:26.610 --> 00:05:27.440
Take care.

00:05:39.280 --> 00:05:40.860
Don't even try it!

00:05:41.150 --> 00:05:44.100
Hey, you, old-timer, 
you were talking just now!

00:05:44.100 --> 00:05:45.870
You were talking, I know you were!

00:05:46.850 --> 00:05:48.550
Don't shake your head!

00:05:48.550 --> 00:05:50.870
You understand every 
last thing I'm saying.

00:05:56.700 --> 00:05:58.300
H-Hey...

00:06:06.150 --> 00:06:09.580
You played with ants when 
you were a kid, right?

00:06:09.580 --> 00:06:11.320
I sure did.

00:06:11.770 --> 00:06:13.500
I'd get naked and then have

00:06:13.500 --> 00:06:16.180
the ants creep and crawl 
all over my naked body.

00:06:16.180 --> 00:06:18.510
Uh, nobody does that.

00:06:18.510 --> 00:06:21.110
I'm talking about pouring water

00:06:21.110 --> 00:06:23.400
into an anthill and massacring them.

00:06:24.190 --> 00:06:25.070
Huh?

00:06:29.580 --> 00:06:30.690
We're just imagining things.

00:06:30.690 --> 00:06:31.790
For sure.

00:06:32.350 --> 00:06:34.310
I'm sorry!

00:06:34.310 --> 00:06:37.360
But you kept shaking me around, see?

00:06:38.530 --> 00:06:39.690
I can still smell it.

00:06:39.690 --> 00:06:41.380
Get out!

00:06:41.380 --> 00:06:42.970
My Alma Ener—

00:06:42.970 --> 00:06:44.550
What did you say?

00:06:44.550 --> 00:06:45.670
Nothing at all.

00:06:46.880 --> 00:06:48.520
You seriously want me to buy that?!

00:06:48.520 --> 00:06:51.600
Hey, buddy, say it, don't spray it!

00:06:51.600 --> 00:06:53.670
You're one to talk!

00:06:53.670 --> 00:06:55.820
I'm one to talk? Seriously?!

00:06:55.820 --> 00:06:58.090
You're not sorry. Not at all.

00:06:58.090 --> 00:07:01.100
Want me to turn you inside out again?

00:07:03.260 --> 00:07:05.570
Kid, you're seriously irritating.

00:07:06.010 --> 00:07:08.050
Your stuffing is totally some old guy!

00:07:08.050 --> 00:07:11.030
You need to respect your elders!

00:07:11.030 --> 00:07:12.420
You're not human.

00:07:12.420 --> 00:07:16.040
I'm something like a human, 
that's close enough!

00:07:16.040 --> 00:07:17.370
Got it, idiot?!

00:07:17.370 --> 00:07:18.500
So you're human?

00:07:18.830 --> 00:07:22.490
If you're human, why don't you 
tell me what you're up to?

00:07:22.490 --> 00:07:23.850
Who were you talking to?

00:07:23.850 --> 00:07:24.960
What's the big idea?

00:07:25.980 --> 00:07:28.380
You think I'll tell you?!

00:07:32.690 --> 00:07:34.330
Not so fast, old-timer.

00:07:34.330 --> 00:07:38.600
If you think I intend to 
do nothing, think again.

00:07:38.600 --> 00:07:40.240
You ain't seen nothing yet!

00:07:40.240 --> 00:07:41.310
Oh, I ain't seen nothing?

00:07:41.310 --> 00:07:42.620
What a load of crap!

00:07:42.620 --> 00:07:43.900
I'm shaking in my boots!

00:07:44.340 --> 00:07:46.160
Ta-da!

00:07:46.160 --> 00:07:48.570
It's exciting torture time!

00:07:48.570 --> 00:07:49.410
Water attack!

00:07:50.110 --> 00:07:51.650
Say no to animal abuse!

00:07:51.650 --> 00:07:52.990
I'm an endangered species!

00:07:55.770 --> 00:07:57.430
You lose.

00:07:57.430 --> 00:08:01.760
What I'm abusing here 
isn't an animal at all!

00:08:04.130 --> 00:08:06.210
Whip! Whip! Whip!

00:08:07.140 --> 00:08:07.920
Wax!

00:08:07.920 --> 00:08:08.920
Wooden horse!

00:08:08.920 --> 00:08:10.170
Ball gag!

00:08:10.170 --> 00:08:11.480
Stop, stop!

00:08:11.480 --> 00:08:15.260
That's not torture anymore, 
some people go for this sort of thing!

00:08:16.410 --> 00:08:18.510
Oh no, it's waking up!

00:08:18.510 --> 00:08:20.250
This thing inside of me,

00:08:20.250 --> 00:08:23.380
this slumbering, slippery thing 
inside of me, it's awakening!

00:08:24.540 --> 00:08:25.650
I'll talk!

00:08:25.650 --> 00:08:26.640
I'll talk, so don't stop.

00:08:26.640 --> 00:08:28.270
I mean, stop!

00:08:31.380 --> 00:08:35.030
I hope you'll take responsibility 
after all you did.

00:08:35.030 --> 00:08:37.870
Excuse me? You brought 
that on yourself.

00:08:38.330 --> 00:08:40.730
I can't go back to who I was before.

00:08:40.730 --> 00:08:42.270
Oh, just shut up and talk already!

00:08:43.940 --> 00:08:46.040
You won't be shocked 
by what I have to say?

00:08:46.040 --> 00:08:48.790
You mean, beyond you 
talking in and of itself?

00:08:49.460 --> 00:08:50.800
You won't get mad, right?

00:08:51.250 --> 00:08:52.460
Too late.

00:08:52.790 --> 00:08:54.350
To be honest,

00:08:55.980 --> 00:09:00.360
women consider me a sort of living ware.

00:09:00.360 --> 00:09:02.600
Men consider me an accessory.

00:09:03.740 --> 00:09:05.270
What are you talking about?

00:09:05.270 --> 00:09:06.560
You mean like a decoration?

00:09:06.820 --> 00:09:08.890
It's a little different.

00:09:08.890 --> 00:09:12.970
Put another way, being unable 
to manage your finances

00:09:12.970 --> 00:09:15.570
leads to financial problems.

00:09:15.950 --> 00:09:17.700
Who are you working for?

00:09:17.700 --> 00:09:19.160
You got it all wrong!

00:09:19.160 --> 00:09:21.340
Think about it!

00:09:21.340 --> 00:09:22.760
I'll tell you again.

00:09:22.760 --> 00:09:24.940
Both things are essentially the same,

00:09:24.940 --> 00:09:27.130
but if you write it in 
katakana, you can touch it,

00:09:27.130 --> 00:09:28.830
and if you write it 
in kanji, you can't.

00:09:28.830 --> 00:09:30.490
That's what I mean.

00:09:30.490 --> 00:09:32.560
What do you mean, katakana?

00:09:32.560 --> 00:09:34.920
What is this, a riddle?

00:09:34.920 --> 00:09:36.080
That's right!

00:09:36.080 --> 00:09:38.290
Why are we on a game show now?

00:09:39.500 --> 00:09:41.340
For a man, you're an accessory.

00:09:41.340 --> 00:09:42.440
Management.

00:09:42.440 --> 00:09:45.300
Breasts or boobies.

00:09:45.300 --> 00:09:46.430
Bankruptcy.

00:09:46.430 --> 00:09:47.740
Papa or dad.

00:09:47.740 --> 00:09:48.620
Is that it?

00:09:48.570 --> 00:09:49.980
You got it!

00:09:50.300 --> 00:09:52.890
Wow, my success rate is amazing!

00:09:52.890 --> 00:09:54.630
First prize, no questions asked!

00:09:54.630 --> 00:09:56.810
Seriously?!

00:09:57.180 --> 00:09:58.030
Wait a second.

00:09:58.030 --> 00:09:59.990
Breasts? Bankruptcy? Papa?

00:10:00.250 --> 00:10:01.360
That's it!

00:10:01.360 --> 00:10:03.110
I am your father!

00:10:03.110 --> 00:10:04.920
What language are you—

00:10:04.920 --> 00:10:06.250
What language was that?!

00:10:06.250 --> 00:10:09.180
Wait, what language are 
we talking in now?

00:10:09.710 --> 00:10:11.630
Thinking about it, I feel really 
sick all of a sudden.

00:10:11.630 --> 00:10:13.130
That's what got you?!

00:10:13.460 --> 00:10:16.020
Here I thought I had calmed you down.

00:10:16.020 --> 00:10:19.310
But they say children never can 
understand a parent's heart.

00:10:19.310 --> 00:10:20.140
Liar!

00:10:20.660 --> 00:10:24.690
What?! F-Father?!

00:10:24.690 --> 00:10:25.890
You're so slow!

00:10:25.890 --> 00:10:28.230
Father? You're a totally 
different species.

00:10:28.230 --> 00:10:30.270
We're even further then 
say, a human and a monkey.

00:10:30.610 --> 00:10:32.590
You've got hair all over your body!

00:10:32.590 --> 00:10:35.880
Look, I've only got hair 
on top of my head.

00:10:35.880 --> 00:10:37.220
And a little in my crotch.

00:10:37.220 --> 00:10:38.900
A small detail.

00:10:38.900 --> 00:10:40.410
No, it's not!

00:10:42.590 --> 00:10:43.840
Now do you get it?

00:10:43.840 --> 00:10:45.640
This is not my true form.

00:10:46.460 --> 00:10:49.370
Then what was that little 
4D pocket you had before?

00:10:49.370 --> 00:10:50.870
What was that for?

00:10:50.870 --> 00:10:53.720
The body, you know, is the 
servant of the mind.

00:10:53.720 --> 00:10:57.200
Close your eyes and say that 
you'll burn me with a poker.

00:10:57.200 --> 00:11:00.440
Even if you use ice 
instead, I'll get burned.

00:11:00.440 --> 00:11:03.690
That's why I have my pocket.

00:11:04.210 --> 00:11:06.340
By having that kind of 
extra step involved,

00:11:06.340 --> 00:11:08.410
things make sense to the mind,

00:11:08.410 --> 00:11:11.630
and everything works more smoothly.

00:11:11.630 --> 00:11:13.400
I don't get it.

00:11:13.400 --> 00:11:15.310
It's like screaming out a move's name.

00:11:15.310 --> 00:11:16.530
It's partly to focus yourself,

00:11:16.530 --> 00:11:18.610
but it's also for attuning the 
device's voice recognition.

00:11:18.610 --> 00:11:19.820
Enough!

00:11:20.490 --> 00:11:23.280
What I want to know is 
why are you my father?

00:11:23.280 --> 00:11:25.780
Call me Papa, if you like.

00:11:26.100 --> 00:11:29.170
This little squirrel thing 
is really pissing me off.

00:11:29.170 --> 00:11:31.310
I just feel like punching it.

00:11:31.310 --> 00:11:34.720
Why is my son so scary?

00:11:35.790 --> 00:11:39.090
I know this isn't easy to believe.

00:11:39.620 --> 00:11:41.720
If I butt in, I lose, huh?

00:11:41.720 --> 00:11:43.930
That's my boy!

00:11:47.120 --> 00:11:54.020
The day you were born, 
your mother and I were so happy!

00:11:56.750 --> 00:11:57.850
What's that?

00:11:57.850 --> 00:12:00.280
Some wizards have come to bless him?

00:12:00.280 --> 00:12:01.800
That's wonderful!

00:12:01.800 --> 00:12:03.340
Invite them in already!

00:12:03.840 --> 00:12:06.620
All right everyone, eat and 
drink to your heart's content!

00:12:06.910 --> 00:12:07.900
Hey!

00:12:07.900 --> 00:12:09.490
Why are you all shutting me out?

00:12:09.490 --> 00:12:10.370
I'll curse you!

00:12:10.370 --> 00:12:13.050
I'll curse you with 
every fiber of my soul!

00:12:13.050 --> 00:12:14.120
Die!

00:12:14.470 --> 00:12:17.890
What have you done?

00:12:17.890 --> 00:12:18.880
Don't panic!

00:12:18.880 --> 00:12:20.420
I'll save the day.

00:12:20.920 --> 00:12:22.580
Pipiruma sperma!

00:12:22.580 --> 00:12:27.580
Things might be a little this or 
that, but at least he won't die.

00:12:29.080 --> 00:12:31.690
And after this and that, 
I turned into what you see today.

00:12:31.690 --> 00:12:33.000
What I see today?

00:12:33.000 --> 00:12:35.050
The only difference is that 
you don't have a crown on!

00:12:35.050 --> 00:12:36.670
Oh, really?

00:12:38.550 --> 00:12:41.990
I think this joke is getting old.

00:12:41.990 --> 00:12:43.380
What?!

00:12:43.380 --> 00:12:47.180
You reduce my heartfelt 
explanation into a mere farce?

00:12:48.490 --> 00:12:49.640
Now hang on here.

00:12:49.640 --> 00:12:51.930
What's "this and that" anyway?

00:12:51.930 --> 00:12:53.360
Your story doesn't add up!

00:12:53.360 --> 00:12:56.410
Fine, I'll tell you more 
about "this and that." Okay?

00:12:56.410 --> 00:12:58.500
You're so impatient.

00:13:06.380 --> 00:13:11.670
No, my ball fell into the pond!

00:13:11.670 --> 00:13:14.440
Won't you be my friend?

00:13:15.090 --> 00:13:17.190
I'll bring your ball 
back if you say yes.

00:13:17.620 --> 00:13:18.690
Really?

00:13:20.630 --> 00:13:22.940
You said you'd be my 
friend, so how about it?

00:13:23.260 --> 00:13:26.450
Won't you be my friend?

00:13:28.700 --> 00:13:33.740
And if things go well, 
we could become more...

00:13:35.450 --> 00:13:37.520
I know what's going to happen.

00:13:37.520 --> 00:13:39.040
Really?

00:13:39.340 --> 00:13:42.360
They kiss and the ugly frog 
turns into a handsome prince.

00:13:42.360 --> 00:13:43.860
And they live happily ever after.

00:13:43.860 --> 00:13:49.050
Or not, actually the princess 
snaps and splatters

00:13:49.050 --> 00:13:50.300
the frog against the wall.

00:13:51.590 --> 00:13:55.670
And as the frog dies, 
he turns into a prince.

00:13:55.670 --> 00:13:59.090
Maybe that's absurd or unreasonable, 
but whatever, right?

00:13:59.090 --> 00:14:01.320
Fairy tales usually are.

00:14:01.490 --> 00:14:04.360
W-W-W-W-Wait!

00:14:04.970 --> 00:14:06.880
No, no I say!

00:14:06.880 --> 00:14:08.290
That doesn't count!

00:14:08.290 --> 00:14:09.780
That doesn't count?

00:14:09.780 --> 00:14:14.870
I've been waiting for so long, 
my memory's gotten all mixed up!

00:14:15.340 --> 00:14:17.320
Mixed up is the understatement 
of the year.

00:14:17.320 --> 00:14:18.400
N-N-N-N-No!

00:14:18.400 --> 00:14:19.410
Hear me out?

00:14:19.410 --> 00:14:21.840
You don't know how long 
I've been waiting for you.

00:14:22.150 --> 00:14:26.090
You don't know how I craned 
my neck, searching for you.

00:14:26.380 --> 00:14:29.840
That reminds me, 
how many years ago was that?

00:14:29.840 --> 00:14:32.350
That's right, when there was not 
yet anything on this earth!

00:14:32.350 --> 00:14:35.030
If you start your story back 
before creation itself,

00:14:35.030 --> 00:14:36.850
I swear I will turn you 
into a squashed tomato.

00:14:36.850 --> 00:14:37.820
Eek!

00:14:37.820 --> 00:14:39.540
Eek my ass!

00:14:40.780 --> 00:14:41.840
Fine, I'll just tell you.

00:14:41.850 --> 00:14:44.530
You're a chosen person and 
I'm here to look after you,

00:14:44.530 --> 00:14:47.950
